he
> VS2K that would allow it to boot off of a SCSI disk.  =

It is at ftp://ftp.gwdg.de/pub/vms/pk2k/ but is is no image. You have to
dump the PROM code and patch it. I connected my VS2k to my server
running NetBSD, dumped the PROM code via =

examine/b/p 20040000 /n:3ffff
used kermit to log the dump to a file and converted this hexdump with =

awk  '/^  P 200/ {printf "%c", $3}' > ka410prom.dump
to a binary file. I will do the patch and burn new EPROMs in the next
days to get my VS2k prepared vor the german VAXgeek meeting. :-) =

