The correct pinout for the external SCSI connector from a VS3100
model 76 is as follows :

         Pin number               Signal name
               2                    -DB(0)
               3                     GND
               4                    -DB(1)
               5                     GND
               6                    -DB(2)
               7                     GND
               8                    -DB(3)
               9                     GND
              10                    -DB(4)
              11                     GND
              12                    -DB(5)
              13                     GND
              14                    -DB(6)
              15                     GND
              16                    -DB(7)
              17                     GND
              18                    -DB(P)
              19                    -ATN
              20                    -BSY
              21                    -ACK
              22                     GND
              23                    -RST
              24                    -MSG
              25                    -SEL
              26                    -C/D
              27                    -REQ
              28                    -I/O
              29                     Termpwr2
              30                     GND
              36                     GND
              40                     GND
              42                     GND
              46                     GND
              48                     GND
              56                     GND

Other pins are not used.


