You don't need to reformat the drive.  Formatting the drive will not
affect this problem.

You need what is called a SCSI MODE PAGE editor.  These are available
for the PC, but I can't remember any names right now.  The ones that I
have seen have requried an Adaptec SCSI controller.

You want to make sure that AWRE, ARRE, and RC are all zero.  These are
found in the error correction page.

Good luck!

