> Is there a way to get them works together?
> 
> No, I don't have another controller, I can't buy another controller,
> but yes, I can format the disk in another place. :)

The RQDXA isn't a controller.  The controller is an RQDX1, RQDX2, or
RQDX3.

The Maxtor XT1140 won't work on any of them.  If you had a Maxtor
XT2190, that would work on an RQDX3 as an RD54.  But it wouldn't work on
an RQDX1 or RQDX2.



